		"Id": "mechdef_jinggau_JN-G8M",
		"Name": "Jinggau",
		"Details": "The Jinggau (which means siren) is a new pride of the Capellan Confederation. Well armed and well armored, the Jinggau is designed to form the anchor of the CCAF's warrior houses. Powered by a 325-rated XL engine and built on an Endo-Steel frame, the Jinggau easily brings its warload to bear. A single Superheavy Lance tied to a targetting computer and enough cooling to tape the fire button down means the Jinggau is walking death to vehicles and Mechs alike. Four rare Medium Pulse Lasers round out the 8M's unusual armnament.  \n\n <b><color=#e51717>COMMUNITY CONTENT</color></b>",
		"Icon": "uixTxrIcon_jinggau"
	},
